<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9622] MVCC Cache API: prohibit non PESSIMISTIC REPEATABLE_READ transactions</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9622</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;For cache with enabled mvcc we should allow running only PESSIMISTIC REPEATABLE_READ transactions. For other modes exception should be thrown (like is done for SQL API).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13185563">IGNITE-9622</key>
            <summary>MVCC Cache API: prohibit non PESSIMISTIC REPEATABLE_READ transactions</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
